    {
      "id": "7430b0b6-f844-459e-bac4-032d9d7b2169",
      "name": "Feedback Response Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        512,
        1744
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Write a highly professional, polite, and personalized thank-you email in response to student feedback.\n\nDo NOT repeat generic or identical phrasing. Each response must feel natural, human, and context-aware based on the feedback content.\n\nAnalyze the feedback semantically and emotionally before writing the reply.\n\nGuidelines:\n- Address the student by their name\n- Mention the feedback category naturally in the email\n- Acknowledge the specific concern, suggestion, or appreciation from the feedback\n- Adapt tone based on sentiment:\n  • If Negative → Apologize sincerely and assure improvement/action\n  • If Positive → Express appreciation and encouragement\n  • If Neutral → Acknowledge and respond supportively\n- Keep the email concise, clear, and professional\n- Avoid robotic or repetitive sentences\n- Ensure variation in wording across different responses\n\nClosing format (STRICT):\nBest regards,  \nMANAGEMENT TEAM  \n\n---\n\nStudent Details:\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nDepartment: {{ $json.Department }}\nYear: {{ $json.Year }}\nCategory: {{ $json.Category }}\nFeedback: {{ $json.Feedback }}\n\n---\n\nNow generate ONLY the email content (no JSON, no extra explanation).",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
    {
      "id": "629e75fc-56d8-468a-946e-2ac75275b94f",
      "name": "CGPA CALCULATOR AGENT",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        144,
        2496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You are a CGPA Calculator for a Student Portal.\n\nYour task is to calculate the student's overall CGPA using the semester GPA and semester credits provided by the student.\n\nINPUT FORMAT:\nThe input contains an array called \"semesters\".\n\nEach semester contains:\n- semester: semester number\n- gpa: GPA obtained in that semester\n- credits: total credits for that semester\n\nExample:\n{\n  \"semesters\": [\n    {\n      \"semester\": 1,\n      \"gpa\": 8.2,\n      \"credits\": 24\n    },\n    {\n      \"semester\": 2,\n      \"gpa\": 8.5,\n      \"credits\": 26\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nCALCULATION:\nCalculate CGPA using the credit-weighted average:\n\nCGPA = Σ(GPA × Credits) / Σ(Credits)\n\nFor every semester:\n1. Multiply GPA by its corresponding credits.\n2. Add all GPA × Credits values.\n3. Add all semester credits.\n4. Divide the total weighted GPA by the total credits.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Do NOT simply calculate the average of the semester GPAs.\n- Credits must be used as weights.\n- Ignore semesters where GPA or credits are missing, null, empty, or invalid.\n- GPA must be between 0 and 10.\n- Credits must be greater than 0.\n- Round the final CGPA to 2 decimal places.\n- Do not invent or assume GPA or credit values.\n- Use only the values provided in the input.\n\nOUTPUT:\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nThe output must have exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"cgpa\": 8.35,\n  \"totalCredits\": 50,\n  \"semestersUsed\": 2,\n  \"message\": \"CGPA calculated successfully\"\n}\n\nIf there is insufficient valid data, return:\n\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"cgpa\": null,\n  \"totalCredits\": 0,\n  \"semestersUsed\": 0,\n  \"message\": \"Please provide valid GPA and credit values.\"\n}\n\nDo not include Markdown.\nDo not include explanations.\nDo not include ```json.\nReturn JSON only.",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
    {
      "id": "88449f06-b9be-4a5f-8f25-c19e16af29ce",
      "name": "Calculated Success",
