        "content": "💬 𝗦𝘁𝘂𝗱𝗲𝗻𝘁 𝗙𝗲𝗲𝗱𝗯𝗮𝗰𝗸 & 𝗥𝗲𝘀𝗽𝗼𝗻𝘀𝗲 𝗔𝘂𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻\n\nCollects and stores student feedback in Supabase for organized tracking and management. AI analyzes the feedback and generates a personalized, professional response based on its sentiment, category, and content."
