      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "The Student Portal Webhook receives POST requests from the frontend and acts as the main entry point for the n8n workflow. It collects student actions such as registration, login, profile updates, feedback, and CGPA calculations, then passes the data to the appropriate workflow."
